Package: whereAreECDNAs
Type: Package
Title: Identify ecDNA-positive cells from single-cell ATAC-seq data
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-12-29
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chu", "Pan", email = "chu.uhnresearch@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yanlin", "Chen", role = c("aut")),
    person("Ankita", "Nand", role = c("aut"))
  )
Description: Provides functions to process single-cell ATAC-seq data for the
    identification of extrachromosomal DNA (ecDNA)-positive cells. The package
    supports input loading, object construction, pseudobulk generation, peak
    calling, peak-by-cell matrix construction, ecDNA content quantification, and
    probabilistic classification of ecDNA-positive cells.
